{"id":"blitz","lemma":"Blitz","pos":"noun","rank":2613,"glosses":["a bolt of lightning","flash"],"ipa":"/blɪts/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/De-Blitz2.ogg/De-Blitz2.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Blitzes","plural":"Blitze"},"formAudio":{"Blitzes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Blitzes.wav","Blitze":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Blitze.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich wurde vom Blitz getroffen.","en":"I got hit by lightning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756117","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"from the"},null,{"g":"hit, struck, met"}]},{"text":"Blitze können gefährlich sein.","en":"Lightning can be dangerous.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"dangerous, hazardous"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Das Haus wurde gestern vom Blitz getroffen.","en":"The house was struck by lightning yesterday.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"from the"},null,{"g":"hit, struck, met"}]},{"text":"Der Baum ist vom Blitz getroffen worden.","en":"The tree was struck by lightning.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"tree"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"from the"},null,{"g":"hit, struck, met"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]},{"text":"Der Blitz blendete mich einen Moment.","en":"The lightning blinded me for a moment.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"moment"}]}]}